## Midwater

@narrator{code="0010"}: Halfway out, the lanterns bunch around the boat like cats at a door.
@lumi{code="0010"}: Someone should keep watch at the bow. Who do you trust with that?
<branch id="c4s2Watch" prompt="Who keeps watch at the bow?">
  <choice id="aria" text="Aria." when="holds('owned', ['aria'])">
    @aria{code="0010" emotion="happy"}: Me? Of course. I'll call out every star I see. Loudly.
    ::assert{rowedWith(aria)}
  </choice>
  <choice id="cyra" text="Cyra." when="holds('owned', ['cyra'])">
    @cyra{code="0010" emotion="sleepy"}: I'll watch. With my eyes closed. It's a priestess thing.
    ::assert{rowedWith(cyra)}
  </choice>
  <choice id="nyx" text="Nyx." when="holds('owned', ['nyx'])">
    @nyx{code="0010" emotion="shy"}: The lanterns know me. They'll behave.
    ::assert{rowedWith(nyx)}
  </choice>
  <choice id="lumi" text="Lumi can do it.">
    @lumi{code="0020" emotion="smug"}: Obviously. I'm a guide star. Guiding is the job.
  </choice>
</branch>
